On our DEC Alpha running DEC OSF/1 V1.3 we will occassionally have a hung 
dump process and remaining semaphores and shared memory segments.  I think
all you need to do is check for these hung dump processes and clear the ipc
semaphores and shared memroy segments.  As root check for these using ipcs -a
and clear any setments you might find by hand.  Man ipcs will help.

