devices for /dev/rz3.  Then make the /etc/fdmns/root_domain directory.
Then make a soft-link to the device where root lives.

ie:

Drop into the system management sh shell.

# cd /dev
# ./MAKEDEV rz3
....
# mkdir  /etc/fdmns
# mkdir /etc/fdmns/root_domain
# cd /etc/fdmns/root_domain
# ln -s /dev/rz3a rz3a
# mkdir /mnt
# mount root_domain#root /mnt

