We use mkisofs a PD package for Pre-mastering ISO 9660 CD-ROM's. This
is available for various FTP sites (sorry I can't rember where we got our
copy). So far all the CD's we have produced have been OK. mkisofs supports 
rock ridge extensions, as well as standard ISO 9660. 

