From 3rd Degree User Guide:

"If you don't trust your software -- and you shouldn't -- give it The Third 
Degree.

Third Degree is a tool which performs memory access checks and memory leak
detection of C and C++ programs at run time. It accomplishes this by adding
code to executables at link time, using ATOM. The added code performs run-time
